HB0260 Criminal accountability grant program.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Washut and Harshman and Senator(s)
Driskill and Nethercott
AN ACT relating to administration of the government; establishing a program to
provide grants to cities and towns to offset the costs of specified criminal
activity; requiring rulemaking; requiring reports; providing an appropriation;
and providing for effective dates.
